Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.07,0:02:02.87,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}A{\1c&H778D3A&}n{\1c&H6F9B4B&}d{\1c&H66AA5D&} {\1c&H60B56A&}t{\1c&H59C179&}h{\1c&H50D18C&}o{\1c&H48E09E&}s{\1c&H4BE4AB&}e{\1c&H61D8B2&} {\1c&H73CEB9&}d{\1c&H8BC1C0&}a{\1c&HA3B4C8&}y{\1c&HB9A8D0&}s{\1c&HCC9DD6&} {\1c&HE490DE&}w{\1c&HED91D7&}i{\1c&HEE95CF&}l{\1c&HEE98C8&}l{\1c&HEF9EBE&} {\1c&HF0A6AF&}b{\1c&HF1AF9E&}e{\1c&HF2B690&} {\1c&HF3BE80&}h{\1c&HF4C76F&}a{\1c&HE5BE6E&}p{\1c&HCAA57A&}p{\1c&HAF8C86&}y{\1c&H9E7D8D&},{\1c&H8C6C95&} {\1c&H77599E&}t{\1c&H5C41AA&}o{\1c&H4128B6&}o{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:10.46,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:26.01,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.06,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:35.93,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:40.44,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:45.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:50.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:55.49,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:21:01.25,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.25,0:21:06.09,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:11.72,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:16.50,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:21.59,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:26.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:31.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:25.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:33.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:40.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:48.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:42.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I want one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:50.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa used to make them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I want my own knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're still young...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There are kids' knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:07.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now hurry and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:18.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We gotta get going soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:35.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that baby cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:39.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:47.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kawachi, Kaga Rin's father's relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:52.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking care of Rin right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.21,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:58.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... You're Yoshii Masako...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:01.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.77,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:05.39,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:06.93,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:10.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to meet you in person to talk about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:14.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind coming to you, so if you'll just pick a place...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:17.64,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,A place... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:21.00,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I don't know... I guess in the shopping area, at the...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:24.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna have to be a bit more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,More crafts, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:44.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You made this flower too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:46.78,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. It's called embroidery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:50.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:54.16,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,When you get a little bigger, I'll teach you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.71,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Only because you're so clever with your hands, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.40,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,So, what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say until I meet her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.71,0:05:08.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Keep an eye on Rin while I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.86,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.86,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,This is important...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.71,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,so have a good, long talk with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:17.29,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's been looking forward to spending time with Rin anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:30.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is really close to Grandpa's house...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.47,Default,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.03,Default,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alone, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:35.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,One more person is coming afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:37.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Non-smoking, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.44,Default,Mother A,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Careful!! You're gonna spill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.50,Default,Mother B,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}The stress just keeps building...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.80,Default,Mother C,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Believe me, I've been there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Americano, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:46.76,Default,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,One Americano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.39,Default,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:48.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:51.92,Default,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}This is very nice, Ms. Saionji!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:53.22,Default,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}But I'd expect no less from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.67,Default,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Now you just need to give each character some trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:56.88,Default,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Two or three each is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.51,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}D-Don't you think that's a bit much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:01.24,Default,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}No, it's just right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:02.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This doesn't make sense...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:05.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After going through all the trouble of hiding that she was ever at Grandpa's...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:07.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why stay in the same neighborhood?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.01,Default,Editor,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'll see you later, Ms. Saionji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:11.68,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:15.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Pretty careless for someone trying to disappear...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:17.21,Default,Boy A,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Mama, I have to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.27,Default,Mother D,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Yes, yes. Just hold on for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:26.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:28.70,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm already in the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.80,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,S-Souichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:43.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No. His grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:53.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's like a little kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:56.00,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.70,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that you look so much like him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:58.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:04.07,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I have a chance to really look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:07.14,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I think Souichi looked kinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:07.92,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I brought a photo of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:14.41,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It was taken at the beginning of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's at a rice cake party at her kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:26.66,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She looks like a young lady already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:38.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I heard someone call you "Miss" earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:39.76,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Were you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But the name was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:42.42,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's my pen name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:43.43,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:46.76,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm totally out of it after pulling an all-nighter because of deadline hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:47.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:55.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is work the reason you left Rin behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:58.00,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And apparently you made Rin think that you were just the housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you do that ever since she was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:06.56,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Mm... My work {\i1}is{\i0} the reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:11.37,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,However, it's also true that I was Souichi's maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:14.81,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Even while I was pregnant, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.81,0:08:16.43,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I refused to think of Rin as my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:18.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry. I'm not sure I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:21.07,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,For the longest time, I wasn't popular at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.07,0:08:23.73,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Then, just as I was about to finally land a major assignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.06,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I found out that I was pregnant...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:28.66,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't the kind of work you can do while raising a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:31.47,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,but Souichi encouraged me to have the child anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:35.49,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Every day, I'd either work or stay in bed, getting fatter and flabbier...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.17,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, strangely enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:42.45,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,when she was born, she was so cute that I couldn't help but fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Strangely enough"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.88,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, even though I refused to accept her as my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:53.18,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I tried desperately to balance both work and Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:57.15,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It was tough trying to be a day person...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:59.47,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And sometimes I'd have to go out at night for meetings,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:00.76,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,which meant being up late...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:03.31,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It was physically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:14.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I heard that Rin stayed with you in an apartment at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.05,0:09:14.91,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:17.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you go out at night then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.96,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it would be really late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:22.70,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin would already be asleep, so I'd go out for a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.12,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, Souichi would watch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:29.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even now, Rin occasionally wakes up after midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:35.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you think she feels when she finds that she's all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:39.11,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But... how else was I supposed to raise a child on my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:42.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My grandfather wanted the three of you to be a family, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:49.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a problem with me continuing to live with Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:52.59,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:56.48,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not Rin's mother anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:59.11,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the right to make those kinds of choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:03.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even though you were the one who gave birth to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.00,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That has nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you really feel about Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:12.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't she important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:16.26,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:34.03,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I just have one favor to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:40.40,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,When that girl goes to school, please let her use your family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:42.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? My family name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:44.03,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If her surname is different from yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:45.79,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure she'll have a rough time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:48.25,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Can you just promise me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:52.06,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know where you're coming from, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't promise that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:56.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been Kaga Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:11:00.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think a person's name is that easy to change...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:05.51,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,As a woman, I'm not particularly attached to my family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:08.27,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,After all, it might change one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:12.60,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's a woman as well, so she probably feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:16.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but Rin's six...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:18.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And that's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, that's just your opinion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:22.74,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There's only one thing that's important!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.60,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And that's "Rin", the name Souichi gave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.58,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Now, good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:29.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:34.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a man, so I don't really get what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:34.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:37.04,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll still talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:38.65,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:40.95,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,You'd make that little girl decide?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.05,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that cruel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:42.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:47.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking about what's best for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Making the decision for her is what would be cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.82,0:11:54.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I want to ask Rin how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,After that, the two of us will decide together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.31,0:11:58.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll let you know what the answer is later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.74,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It sounds like she's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:14.88,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.94,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Who would abandon a cute little girl like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:18.96,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It defies common sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:22.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Well, she does worry about Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:24.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that she's a bit odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's as if she has no idea she's dragging other people into her mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:28.67,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:31.16,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, a mother would worry about her daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.13,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,If she {\i1}really{\i0} cared about her, she'd want to see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:37.33,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now. We don't know her situation. Have an orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:41.66,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What did Grandpa ever see in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:45.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at this stage, it hardly matters...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:50.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is, she demanded that when Rin starts school, she use my surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:53.08,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:58.08,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,A child should definitely have the same family name as her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:01.38,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I understand, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How am I supposed to explain that to Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:05.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's already got a name of her own...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:10.90,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,She's a girl, so her family name will change when she gets married anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:12.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:13.69,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:16.75,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It'll be easier on her if she uses our family name at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.48,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Better than letting someone tease her for having a different name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:23.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And you think she can keep that all straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:26.79,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,There's a lot going on, even in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.63,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I just don't want things to be difficult for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:34.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What if I adopt Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.01,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:37.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,As long as she doesn't object...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That way, she really will be Kawachi Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:41.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that way's more natural...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:45.32,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a decision you can make so thoughtlessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:46.68,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being thoughtless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:48.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is something that had to happen, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We were going to have to go through this sooner or later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.01,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Easy, easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.20,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's {\i1}not{\i0} all the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:54.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it is! It absolutely is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:58.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not passing the baton to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:01.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That would be the worst thing I could do to Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:07.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If it's for Rin, I'll do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:11.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:15.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:19.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But you can only use when I'm next to you, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:22.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you promise me that, you get to use the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:23.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:28.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,As thanks, I'll make curry for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:30.38,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:30.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How about tomorrow...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:40.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I push or pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:45.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:46.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Give it here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like this, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:53.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're good at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, I've been alone for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:14:59.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do it nice and slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink the bathwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:13.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:23.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Go down to your shoulders and count to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:24.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:26.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,One...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:27.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}One, two... {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:29.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,two, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}three, four, shut the door... {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:32.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}five, six, pick up sticks, seven... {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:35.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,four, five, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Daikichi, you're counting too slowly! {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:41.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't eat too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:42.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:45.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:47.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nevermind...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:53.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your curry's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:09.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I have to do it as long as you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:12.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no... It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mm... You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:19.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:22.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not your big brother either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:25.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody thinks that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What I want to know is, what am I then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:33.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's my name...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:36.61,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, and this is only if you aren't against it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:39.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What I'm trying to say... How can I put it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:43.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... What do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:46.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, what would you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:47.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,about me becoming your real father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.27,0:16:51.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,become my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:57.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So if we did that, your name would become Kawachi Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:00.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi... Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:03.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:09.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it'd be better if you had a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:11.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My father is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:14.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Kaga Rin and I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:16.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same name as Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:20.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:24.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi should just stay Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.18,0:17:30.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:31.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:35.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:37.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's only March...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:38.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:39.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It was open, but you were crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I said I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Move your head up a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:47.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,'Kay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:53.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Y'know, this'll always be your home...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:55.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:09.40,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}We mustn't forget what we believe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:18.41,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}Because the morning will surely come.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:26.71,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}We mustn't lose our dreams.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:34.84,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}Because one day they will surely come true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:43.22,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}The first step... step to tomorrow...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:51.48,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}Starting today, everything will be new!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:19:00.20,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}The first step... step to tomorrow...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:05.12,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}Build that courage up, nice and big...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:09.25,Default,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fad(100,100)}and take that first step out!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.21,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.60,Default,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna get fat, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:10.35,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine. I'm worthless anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:12.59,Default,Boyfriend,0000,0000,0000,,Gimme one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:13.47,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Screw off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Only babies are held like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:01.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's what Sayaka said!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:04.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:06.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There are times when even adults want to be held in someone's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:10.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it still okay to be held, even after I'm a first-grader?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:16.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:24.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you no matter how old you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:29.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.98,0:22:31.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:33.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I should've held you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:34.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:40.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold you next time you cry, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:42.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,100)}Hold on, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:46.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:52.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Am I raising Rin or is she raising me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:54.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I have to wonder sometimes...
